    <div class="twelvecol synopsis hide-for-small last">
        <p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">WELSH FILM FESTIVAL ~ GWYL FFILMIAU CYMRAEG</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Cyfarwyddwr: Marc Evans/2026/UK/91munud/Isdeitlau saesneg</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Wrth ymdopi &#226;'i chylch wythnosol o ddiweithdra, clybio a phen mawr, mae Effi'n cael cyfarfyddiad siawns, mewn clwb nos yn Llandudno, sy'n agor y drws i rywbeth gwell - ond mae'r realiti sy'n dilyn yn llawer anoddach. </span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Isdeitlau saesneg.</span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Yn serennu Leisa Gwenllian a Tom Rhys Harries, yn seiliedig ar fonodrama glodwiw Gary Owen 'Iphigenia in Splott'. </span></p>
<p style="text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px; margin: 0px 0px 0px 0px;"><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;"><br /></span></p>
