background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">Sesto Quatrini</span><span style=" ignore-font-size: 10pt; ignore-font-family: 'Arial', 'Helvetica', sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-weight: normal; ignore-color: #000000; background-color: transparent; text-decoration: none;">&nbsp;returns to conduct Bizet&#8217;s electrifying and sensual score.</span></p>
